mlx-restormer-swift
===================

Port code: MIT (this repository).

Upstream model and weights
--------------------------
Restormer — https://github.com/swz30/Restormer
Zamir et al., "Restormer: Efficient Transformer for High-Resolution Image
Restoration", CVPR 2022.

License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2022 Syed Waqas Zamir and contributors.
See LICENSE-upstream.

NOTE: the same author's MIRNet / MIRNetv2 / MPRNet / CycleISP are covered by an
Academic Public License. Restormer is NOT — it is unqualified MIT. The two are
easy to conflate.

Checkpoints are published first-party as GitHub release v1.0 assets under that
same MIT license. The upstream repository vendors BasicSR (Apache-2.0) as its
training framework; this port depends on none of it — only the architecture file
was read, and no upstream code is vendored here.
